    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 305 Tirellan Heights comes to the market For Sale by Private Treaty. This attractive three-bedroom semi-detached home is ideally situated within a quiet, well-established development, offering off-street parking to the front. Conveniently located in a highly sought-after area, the property is within walking distance of local shops, schools and Galway City Centre.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and well-proportioned throughout, comprising an inviting living room, a spacious kitchen/dining area to the rear with direct access to the garden, two ground-floor bedrooms and a wet room-style bathroom. Upstairs, there is a generous bedroom with en- suite shower room, together with a useful storage room.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a private rear garden with gated side access. The garden is laid to lawn and is enhanced by mature trees and shrubs, providing an attractive outdoor space.\n\nIdeally positioned close to a host of amenities, including the Menlo Park Hotel, Terryland Retail Park, local shops, schools, University of Galway, University Hospital Galway and Galway City Centre, this property is sure to appeal to both owner-occupiers and investors alike. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nCarpet floor.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nCarpet floor, front aspect window.\n\nLiving Room: - \nCarpet floor, front aspect windows, fitted wardrobes, marble fireplace with electric fire, coving.\n\nHotpress - \nShelved hotpress\n\nBedroom 2: - \nCarpet floor, rear aspect window.\n\nBathroom: - \nWetroom style bathroom, fully tiled, wc, wash hand basin, shower, side aspect window.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room: - \nLino floor, fitted kitchen units, plumbed for washing machine, rear aspect window, door to rear garden.\n\nLanding: - \nCarpet stairs and landing.\n\nStorage space: - \nCarpet floor, side velux window.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nCarpet floor, front aspect window.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin, extractor fan.\n\nGarden: - \nRear garden laid in lawn with mature trees and shrubs, block wall boundary, block built boiler house. Parking to the front with gated side access.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Oil fired central heating</li><li>Excellent location</li><li>Parking to the front</li><li>Private rear garden</li><li>Walking distance of all amenities</li><li>Access to bus service</ul>"
      },
